{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_10436225c91522b6d72002002493ca0b7f21522a857462ad0d3393858840b1af"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: the repo is an npm-workspaces monorepo of 8 packages using Node.js 22, TypeScript ~5.7, jest/vitest tests, eslint+prettier, and a solution-style tsc build that must run before cdk synth/deploy."},{"claim_ids":["clm_431feadeb20e4f2b25dce59860e57404d1451dc2bd6695ab70ca0aa28d5a070c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The agent runs as a Docker container on AgentCore Runtime using the Strands Agents SDK (TypeScript), implemented as an Express server on port 8080."},{"claim_ids":["clm_61f99d2df2455d24385ff0fbbeeaa1665bbf1e6b721be2ffb5e7bb5dd9e7fe30"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Real-time streaming is achieved via AppSync Events (WebSocket), and a session-stream-handler Lambda relays DynamoDB Streams to AppSync."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ff261e7a169eac0533978874ee0637e9d83797ec57b9a6b4343afaa2282743c8"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: CI runs secret scanning via detect-secrets through ASH, with test files excluded by globs in .ash/ash.yaml and documented pragma/ignore_paths handling for false positives."}],"claim_ids":["clm_10436225c91522b6d72002002493ca0b7f21522a857462ad0d3393858840b1af","clm_431feadeb20e4f2b25dce59860e57404d1451dc2bd6695ab70ca0aa28d5a070c","clm_61f99d2df2455d24385ff0fbbeeaa1665bbf1e6b721be2ffb5e7bb5dd9e7fe30","clm_ff261e7a169eac0533978874ee0637e9d83797ec57b9a6b4343afaa2282743c8"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:05:41Z","created_by_operation":"op_5df5b50a8dc649eeb41a4e873dcd55b7","id":"pg_3b0f3598dff8501b99df80124462dac6","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/aws-samples-sample-multi-agent-orchestration-chat-on-agentcore-agents--80124462dac6.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_c5748391262a51cab022cc676bb13071"],"title":"aws-samples/sample-multi